Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,800,,{\b1\4c&H0000FF&\fs40}LAUGHING MAN FANSUBS{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.39,0:00:09.29,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I'm a soldier - that means I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:12.69,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Both a defendant and the judge
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.09,0:00:18.09,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I am standing on both ends of the flame
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.77,0:00:22.87,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Rounding curves
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.07,0:00:25.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Overtaking life and death,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.27,0:00:31.67,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,I run and fight with false shadows
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:38.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,No matter how many threads of deception are woven together,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.67,0:00:46.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,The truth shall illuminate the face of light
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.17,0:00:49.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your tears for the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.27,0:00:53.27,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,when our pain is far behind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.67,0:00:56.57,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,on your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:56.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die\Non your feet, come with me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.77,0:00:59.77,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We are soldiers stand or die
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.07,0:01:02.97,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save your fears, take your place
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:06.17,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Save them for the judgement day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.47,0:01:09.37,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,fast and free, follow me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.67,0:01:14.43,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,Time to make the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.47,0:01:20.47,Dialogue,,0,0,900,,We rise or fall
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:48.73,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is she going to the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.13,0:01:50.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Looks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.42,0:01:53.22,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Shall we follow her?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.92,0:01:54.92,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.72,0:01:59.52,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The restroom's floor and walls are tiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.83,0:02:03.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The window is fixed and has an\Naluminium grid on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.83,0:02:06.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,While I think she'd be easily\Ncapable of breaking through that,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.33,0:02:07.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I doubt she'd do anything so crude.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.20,Sign - Copy,,750,0,500,,{\b1}Kusa Meikyu \N \N Grass Labyrinth{\b1}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.00,0:02:37.20,Sign,,0,950,800,, {\fs52}{\b1\i1}Note: This is the title of a 1979 film by Terayama Shuji \N and a pun on Kusanagi{\b1\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.61,0:02:40.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,God, it's hot...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.61,0:02:43.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Here, a present.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:44.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Er, beer... ?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:46.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Damn, you're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:49.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,You people get to break down\Nalcohol with internal implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:54.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Anyway, isn't the difficulty level for the\NSection 9 recruitment test set wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.91,0:02:55.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't be an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:03:00.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If they can't pass something this easy, it\Nmeans the quality of these candidates is low, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:02.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.94,0:03:07.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.94,0:03:08.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.74,0:03:09.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.24,0:03:12.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Reading a newspaper and drinking some coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.64,0:03:14.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Not you; I'm asking about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.54,0:03:17.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, that's who I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:19.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,They're all relaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.74,0:03:26.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if they're incapable of considering the\Npossibility that they may have been fed a false memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:29.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I taught them that right off the bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.44,0:03:30.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How many are left?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.04,0:03:32.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Three pairs, six agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.64,0:03:33.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go on to the next pair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:35.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.97,0:03:43.97,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Is this the last pair?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.27,0:03:46.17,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah, unfortunately.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:58.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Water Bus
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:49.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We're sorry, but we've lost the target!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.29,0:04:52.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Ah. What're you going to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.19,0:04:55.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll try sweeping the area one more time, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.29,0:04:55.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do your best, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.19,0:05:00.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't you being a bit cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.09,0:05:01.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What's the point of feeling sorry for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.09,0:05:04.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.69,0:05:05.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.82,0:05:07.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:10.72,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.95,0:05:13.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm not connecting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.15,0:05:16.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if she got mad and went home already...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:36.70,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A hacking?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:38.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.50,0:05:40.30,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Batou!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.36,0:05:47.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So it is a hack...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.19,0:05:52.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I didn't sense anyone getting past my quad-layer firewall...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.39,0:05:56.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If this is by a trainee, it's pretty impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.60,Sign,,0,0,750,,{\i1} {\fs35}{\b1}Memorabilia Store{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.02,0:06:25.02,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, this is the goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,700,,{\i1} {\fs35}{\b1}Memorabilia Store{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:41.88,Dialogue,,0,0,500,,{\b1}OPEN{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.88,0:06:43.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.27,0:06:49.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What the touch receptors of my skin feel is clearly real...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.07,0:06:54.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,yet... the whole experience is surreal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.31,0:07:53.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Cybernetic bodies...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.61,0:08:10.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Aren't they adorable? Those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.31,0:08:15.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Are you the shopkeeper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.71,0:08:17.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Something like that, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it that you'd like to entrust to this store?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.21,0:08:22.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Entrust?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.86,0:08:23.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.96,0:08:28.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This is a shop that takes in customers' external memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.06,0:08:34.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What we have in this store has no value\Nwhatsoever from another person's point of view,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.96,0:08:39.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but each item has a lot of its\Nformer owner's memories packed into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.36,0:08:45.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Because of that, I sometimes feel\Nbreathless from all the residual thoughts they give off.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.59,0:08:48.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Residual thoughts...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.08,0:09:01.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Weren't you also attracted here by them?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.38,0:09:09.88,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These are very rare models that were made\Nwhen full-body cyborgs were still in their early stages.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:14.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The memories associated with\Nthese children always sadden me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.58,0:09:23.38,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However, at the same time, it allows me to appreciate\Nthe joy of receiving the memories of others for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.18,0:09:26.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What type of memory is\Nassociated with these children?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.98,0:09:30.28,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Goodness gracious, it's already this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.68,0:09:33.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm very sorry, but we're closing early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.78,0:09:36.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Please come by again when you have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.28,0:09:40.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll take my time to tell you the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:09:57.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.89,0:10:00.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That strange sensation was...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.99,0:10:12.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey man, let's go home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.99,0:10:15.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,We'll report to the Major tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.99,0:10:22.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Major, it was really uncool of you to disappear like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.49,0:10:26.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, doing stuff...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:31.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So, how many recruits do you think will actually be hired?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.39,0:10:34.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, there's one guy from the GSDF Intelligence division
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.89,0:10:37.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,with a recommendation from\Nsomeone the Chief knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.69,0:10:39.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How un-reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.69,0:10:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't deny the fact that the\Nquality of our candidates is low,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:44.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but it's also a fact that acquiring reserve\Npersonnel has been given high priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.49,0:10:48.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If we lower the difficulty level any further, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:50.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it just means our resources will be diluted.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:52.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.54,0:10:54.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Further testing at a later date, I guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:57.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll decide after discussing it with the Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.34,0:11:00.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Hey, do you really think I'm\Nsuited to be a training supervisor?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.74,0:11:06.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,If you weren't, no one else would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.64,0:11:08.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll be signing out early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.04,0:11:10.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Take care of the rest, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.84,0:11:15.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.44,0:11:19.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Before joining Section 9, the Major\Nwould have lost me in five minutes too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.64,0:11:20.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.74,0:11:22.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Jeez, you suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.64,0:11:23.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:27.64,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So you're saying you could tail\Na target like the Major
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.74,0:11:30.08,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who can vanish in the blink of an eye - all the way to the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.23,0:11:34.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:39.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A daydream?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:42.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It could have been something more "spiritual"...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.83,0:11:44.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When I turn over in my sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.43,0:11:47.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I sometimes have an out of body\Nexperience and see strange things, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.93,0:11:48.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.53,0:11:53.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, have you ever felt that your possessions have thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:55.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.93,0:12:01.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,On long drives, I've felt as though the car\Nwas an extension of my arms and legs, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.23,0:12:05.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Oh, why don't we call Kuru-tan\Nand go partying for a change?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.63,0:12:06.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:09.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I have something I need to take care of today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.13,0:12:17.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The Major... what is she doing wandering\Naround yesterday's test course?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.36,0:12:44.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did she spot me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:50.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I was waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.76,0:12:54.06,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I thought you'd be coming soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.66,0:12:55.66,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.86,0:12:59.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These children were anxious for you to come, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:01.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.56,0:13:05.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then please tell me about them, about those children.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.76,0:13:07.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,How impatient you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:09.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:15.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,These two cybernetic bodies were\Nbeing carefully preserved by the boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:18.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,who is now a full adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.52,0:13:30.42,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When that boy was six, he was in an airplane accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:34.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It was apparently a huge accident in\Nwhich most of the plane's passengers died,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:39.32,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and I heard that almost all of the\Ninitial survivors passed away...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.02,0:13:45.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,except this boy, and the girl, who\Ncoincidentally sat next to him on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:49.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The two miraculously survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.39,0:13:51.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but the girl did not regain consciousness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.29,0:13:57.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the boy became completely\Nparalysed, save for his left arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.79,0:14:08.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After his injuries healed, the boy immediately\Nunderstood the situation he was in,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.69,0:14:12.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,such as the fact that his parents,\Nwho were also on the plane, were dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.39,0:14:17.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and the reason why his distant relatives, who at\Nfirst came to visit him and were caring towards him,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.89,0:14:20.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,stopped coming all too soon...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.49,0:14:25.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He tried to accept all this as best\Nas he could with his still young mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.29,0:14:31.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and began to think of the girl,\Nwho remained asleep in the bed next to his
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.39,0:14:34.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and was in the same situation as him,\Nas his only friend in the entire world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.59,0:14:39.99,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Please, let her wake up..."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:45.99,Note,,0,0,0,,{\b1\i1}Note: In Japan it is said that a wish will come true if you make one thousand origami cranes{\b0\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.39,0:14:41.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Praying for this to happen,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.69,0:14:45.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he continued to fold origami cranes,\Nusing his left hand as best as he could.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.69,0:14:51.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.19,0:14:54.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Did something happen to the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.09,0:14:58.62,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After a while, the girl's condition suddenly changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.09,0:15:04.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Blood pressure: 60 over nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.49,0:15:06.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Administer one unit each of\Nlidocaine and epinephrine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.79,0:15:08.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I can't get an ECG on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:10.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Her blood pressure's down to 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.29,0:15:12.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Prepare the OR right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:22.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The next morning, the boy was told that\Nthe girl had gone somewhere far away,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.85,0:15:42.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Over the next two years
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.35,0:15:51.35,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,the boy spoke to no one and continued\Nto fold cranes in silence...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:09.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,as if continuing to fold those cranes was\Na serious duty that had been cast upon him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.61,0:16:12.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Has he said anything today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.21,0:16:14.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Just "I want some white origami"...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.91,0:16:18.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,One day, after all the paperwork from\Nthe crash litigation was complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:22.51,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,a young physician came to visit\Nwith one of the boy's relatives,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.11,0:16:24.71,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and asked him,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.81,0:16:33.81,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"If you wish it, there is a treatment you can have that'll\Nrepair all the parts of your body that won't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.91,0:16:36.31,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Do you have the courage to undergo this treatment?"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.91,0:16:41.61,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"If this all goes well, you'll be able to\Nlead a normal life, like you did before."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.41,0:16:47.11,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The boy didn't respond.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.71,0:16:50.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It's not that he couldn't summon\Nenough courage, or anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.01,0:16:52.41,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if you understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.91,0:16:58.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,He had no motivation to want to return\Nto the normal life he had led before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.34,0:17:04.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After all, he had no interest in doing\Nanything anymore, aside from folding cranes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.94,0:17:11.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So the adults gave up trying to persuade him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.74,0:17:17.94,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But one girl opened a window into the boy's heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.64,0:17:20.18,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And that was this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.24,0:17:21.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:26.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,This girl had already undergone successful\Ntreatment to change into a fully cybernetic body.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.63,0:17:34.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The young physician probably brought the two of them\Ntogether in a final attempt to persuade the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.23,0:17:40.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The girl came every day to see the\Nboy, or so the story goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:44.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She was a very cheerful, active girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.33,0:17:49.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,She must have experienced a lot of\Ndifficulty before becoming a full cyborg,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.23,0:17:52.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but she didn't speak a single\Nword about it to the boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:58.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,In contrast, she would periodically\Nencourage him to get cybernetic implants.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.63,0:18:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The boy would listen in silence,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.53,0:18:03.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but one day, he asked,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.63,0:18:07.03,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"Can you fold a crane using your cybernetic body?"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.13,0:18:11.33,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,"If you can, I won't mind becoming a full cyborg."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.33,0:18:15.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.23,0:18:17.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Even though she could make\Nher body exert force,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:22.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,she wasn't able to command it to\Ncarry out delicate movements just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.33,0:18:27.13,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I wonder if the girl didn't like being defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.23,0:18:30.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I heard she tried very hard to fold a crane.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:35.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The girl must have been a source of hope for the boy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.33,0:18:39.93,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,But see, they were still both very young.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.45,0:19:13.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The boy was crestfallen,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:18.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and said that if he couldn't continue to fold\Ncranes for the girl who had passed away,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.15,0:19:20.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he'd be just fine the way he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.15,0:19:25.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,After that day, the girl never\Nappeared before the boy again,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.05,0:19:31.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,leaving behind the words, "This time, I'll\Npractice folding cranes for you, okay?"
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:38.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yes, she was the girl whom the\Nboy had believed to have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.79,0:19:42.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Why did she not tell him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.89,0:19:46.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure there was a very serious reason for that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.29,0:19:55.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but that day, the boy made a\Ndecision to get cybernetic implants
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.59,0:20:00.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and vowed to go meet the girl,\Nwho disappeared from the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:05.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Later on, the boy became a full cyborg,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.79,0:20:07.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,and withstood a difficult rehabilitation
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.89,0:20:11.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to become a very skilled user.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.39,0:20:17.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Since there were very few children\Nwho were full cyborgs at the time,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.29,0:20:20.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it must have been unimaginably difficult for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.89,0:20:25.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Still, when he thought about how the girl\Nmust've borne the same difficulties,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.89,0:20:28.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he overcame his with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.35,0:20:34.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,And... was that girl ever found?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.65,0:20:38.15,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,A girl who was in a plane crash and became a full cyborg...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:41.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That alone should've been a good enough lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.15,0:20:44.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he could not find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:47.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Then, where did he find the girl's cybernetic body...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.75,0:20:50.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,When the boy was at a university lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.85,0:20:54.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he found it being preserved there as a specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.75,0:20:59.55,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The boy knew right away that the\Nbody was the girl he was looking for,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.04,0:21:04.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,but he was ultimately unable to find the girl herself,\Nwho had since moved on to a different body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.74,0:21:09.34,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,So the memories of that girl are still empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.54,0:21:13.04,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where is the boy... right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.74,0:21:15.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Towards the end of the World War,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.34,0:21:21.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he was dispatched overseas.\NHe hasn't come back here since then, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.54,0:21:24.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,he may have died.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.24,0:21:27.24,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.94,0:21:33.74,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Thank you for telling me the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:39.84,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I'm sure that the girl is also still looking\Nfor the first boy she liked, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.44,0:21:42.44,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The first boy she liked...?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:11.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The ice in your iced tea has all melted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:13.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.19,0:22:15.19,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.59,0:22:18.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, about that bunch's testing...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.49,0:22:23.29,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I want to let them try again after\Nrethinking the difficulty setting.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.39,0:22:24.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.69,0:22:26.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Where's this coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.99,0:22:28.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Well, you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.19,0:22:32.79,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I remembered how I used to get\Nyelled at by my instructor,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.89,0:22:37.39,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,back when I first joined, because I couldn't\Nreally be at my full potential either...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.79,0:22:39.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.19,0:22:43.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Maybe no one can do that\Nwell from the very beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.19,0:22:44.89,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.49,0:22:48.59,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,It helps that you say that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.66,0:23:10.46,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Finding out a galaxy
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.56,0:23:14.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,of planets and stars within me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.16,0:23:17.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,Listening to each of them
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.36,0:23:21.16,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,singing the same silent melody.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.26,0:23:25.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I've never seen such beauty
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.36,0:23:28.49,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,in possibility...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.66,0:23:32.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,No smack of doubt or fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.26,0:23:34.76,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.86,0:23:35.69,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.69,0:23:36.86,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.86,0:23:37.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:39.09,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.\N(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.09,0:23:39.96,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.97,0:23:41.14,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.63,0:23:42.23,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.23,0:23:43.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)\NI see inside
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:44.26,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.26,0:23:46.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is right)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.43,0:23:47.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.66,0:23:48.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.20,0:23:49.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:49.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.80,0:23:50.68,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:51.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.\NAll I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.21,0:23:53.21,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.30,0:23:54.36,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(it's inside)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.56,0:23:57.57,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,The beauty within the shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.57,0:23:58.54,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(deep within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.99,0:23:59.91,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(within the shell)
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.97,0:24:01.43,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.55,0:24:02.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.47,0:24:03.47,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)\NI hear a voice
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.47,0:24:03.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(And show the light)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.25,0:24:06.56,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.56,0:24:07.77,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(Wake up)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.77,0:24:08.53,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,hear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.53,0:24:08.65,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)\Nhear a voice calling out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.65,0:24:08.75,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.75,0:24:10.85,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,I see inside,\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.85,0:24:10.95,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.95,0:24:12.63,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.\N(the time is now)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.63,0:24:14.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,see the light now ever holding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.07,0:24:15.37,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,All the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.37,0:24:15.45,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)\NAll the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.45,0:24:15.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.80,0:24:16.27,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,\N(All the truth)
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.27,0:24:16.80,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,all I need,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.62,0:24:19.82,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,to make all this reality,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.92,0:24:21.05,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,it's inside
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.47,0:24:25.83,Main Dialogue,,0,0,150,,right here within the shell.
